  ],
  "notes": "Relaxation study of NMC811 and LFP cells (landing page); cell ids A123### (LFP) and MJ#### (NMC811). ACImp/DCIR columns exist in the tester files but hold only zeros. The cell is identified only as \"Cell A\" (an internal study label) - no manufacturer or model name appears anywhere in the source, so nominal_capacity_Ah, voltage_min_V/voltage_max_V and dimensions_mm cannot be sourced from a manufacturer datasheet; likely permanently unfillable from public information. The formatted-archive author README documents both Gr,Si//NMC811 and Gr//LFP systems, so dataset-level cathode and anode are mixed; NMC811 alone did not describe the full release. The archive explicitly includes charge records at C/1. All four formatted MAT files were inspected: their fifth column is constant within each relaxation segment and exactly matches the listed temperature conditions. This does not establish measured cell temperature; its measurement-versus-setpoint meaning remains unverified."
 },
